[I] A Python port of the YUI CSS compression algorithm

[T] cssmin is a Python port of the YUI CSS compressor algorithm. It minifies
[T] CSS by removing comments and unnecessary whitespace and shortening
[T] values, and can be used as a library or as a command line filter.

[U] https://github.com/zacharyvoase/cssmin

